## 2. SCHEMA COMPLIANCE

### ❌ FORBIDDEN (Causes 52+ XML Errors)
```xml
<munit:behavior doc:name="anything">
<munit:execution doc:name="anything">
<munit:validation doc:name="anything">
```

### ✅ ALLOWED
```xml
<munit:behavior>
<munit:execution>
<munit:validation>

<munit-tools:mock-when doc:name="Mock API">
<munit-tools:assert-that doc:name="Assert">
<flow-ref doc:name="Call Flow">
```

