## 7. COMMON ERROR FIXES

| Error | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `Unable to infer output media type` | Add `output application/json ---` directive |
| `Prefix "doc" not bound` | Add `xmlns:doc="http://www.mulesoft.org/schema/mule/documentation"` |
| `Unable to find mock for processor` | Verify doc:id matches exactly from source flow |
| `InvalidDataSourceForMimeType` (Salesforce) | Use `output application/json --- [...]` for ArrayList |
| `Target variable null` | Add `<munit-tools:variables>` section to mock |
| `52+ XML schema errors` | Remove `doc:name` from structural elements |
| `LinkedHashMap` (XML stream) | Add `encoding="UTF-8" mediaType="application/xml"` to payload |
| **`Unable to parse empty input` (flow-ref mock)** | **Remove flow-ref mocks with `#[payload]` return. See Section 4.1** |

---

## 8. ERROR PRIORITY MATRIX

Fix errors in this order:

| Priority | Category | Fix |
|----------|----------|-----|
| 1 | SCHEMA | Remove doc:name from structural elements |
| 2 | COMPILATION | Fix XML syntax |
| 3 | NAMESPACE | Add xmlns declarations |
| 4 | PROPERTY | Resolve placeholders |
| 5 | DOCID | Extract correct doc:id from source |
| 6 | ARRAYLIST | Add output directive |
| 7 | TARGET_VAR | Add variables section |
| 8 | RUNTIME | Fix assertions/data |

