## 12. BEHAVIOR VERIFICATION

> **Goal**: Tests must catch regressions when business logic changes

### ❌ WEAK (Coverage only)
```xml
<munit:validation>
    <munit-tools:assert-that expression="#[payload]" is="#[MunitTools::notNullValue()]"/>
</munit:validation>
```

### ✅ STRONG (Behavior verified)
```xml
<munit:validation>
    <!-- Verify output matches expected -->
    <munit-tools:assert-equals actual="#[payload]"
        expected='#[readUrl("classpath://test-data/expected.json", "application/json")]'/>
    <!-- Verify variables set correctly -->
    <munit-tools:assert-that expression="#[vars.sfdcObjectType]" is="#[MunitTools::equalTo('Contact')]"/>
    <!-- Verify critical operations called -->
    <munit-tools:verify-call processor="solace:ack" atLeast="#[1]">
        <munit-tools:with-attributes>
            <munit-tools:with-attribute whereValue="{DOC_ID}" attributeName="doc:id"/>
        </munit-tools:with-attributes>
    </munit-tools:verify-call>
</munit:validation>
```

### Branch Path Verification
```xml
<!-- Verify path was taken -->
<munit-tools:verify-call processor="flow-ref" atLeast="#[1]">...</munit-tools:verify-call>

<!-- Verify path was SKIPPED -->
<munit-tools:verify-call processor="flow-ref" times="#[0]">...</munit-tools:verify-call>
```

### Iteration Count Verification
```xml
<!-- 3 items → 3 publish calls -->
<munit-tools:verify-call processor="solace:publish" times="#[3]">...</munit-tools:verify-call>
```

### Partial Failure Verification
```xml
<!-- Verify error processing called for failed records -->
<munit-tools:verify-call processor="flow-ref" times="#[2]">
    <munit-tools:with-attributes>
        <munit-tools:with-attribute whereValue="{XOMI_ERROR_DOC_ID}" attributeName="doc:id"/>
    </munit-tools:with-attributes>
</munit-tools:verify-call>
```

**Minimum Requirements:**
- ✅ Compare output to expected file
- ✅ Verify critical variables are set correctly
- ✅ Verify connector calls (ack, publish, etc.)
- ✅ Test each choice branch
- ✅ Verify foreach iteration count

